#. module: ai_product
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_product.ai_prompt_enhance_product_image_chatter
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_product.ai_prompt_enhance_product_image_media_manager
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_product.ai_prompt_enhance_product_variant_image_chatter
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_product.ai_prompt_enhance_product_variant_image_media_manager
msgid ""
"1. If an image is provided (<span data-ai-field=\"image_1024\">image_1024</"
"span>):\n"
"    - Ask the user what changes they would like to make. \n"
"    - Provide a few concise example options inspired by the image (e.g., "
"lighting, time of day, motion blur, color temperature, background, etc.). \n"
"    - The response must be **a list of 3 recommended changes**.\n"
"    - Keep it **very concise and direct**.\n"
"        \n"
"2. If no image is provided:\n"
"    - Ask the user to provide an image.\n"
"    - Ask them to mention the enhancements they would like.\n"
"\n"
"Example (image provided):\n"
"    What changes would you like to make to this image?\n"
"    - time of day.\n"
"    - motion blur amount.\n"
"    - background style.\n"
"Example (no image):\n"
"    Please provide an image and tell me what enhancement you would like to "
"see in the image."
msgstr ""
"1. Si une image est fournie (<span data-ai-field=\"image_1024\">image_1024</"
"span>) :\n"
"    - Demandez à l'utilisateur quelles modifications il souhaite apporter.\n"
"    - Proposez quelques exemples concis inspirés de l'image (par ex. : "
"éclairage, moment de la journée, flou de mouvement, température des "
"couleurs, arrière-plan, etc.).\n"
"    - La réponse doit être **une liste de 3 modifications recommandées**.\n"
"    - Restez **très concis et direct**.\n"
"\n"
"2. Si aucune image n'est fournie :\n"
"    - Demandez à l'utilisateur de fournir une image.\n"
"    - Demandez-lui de préciser les améliorations qu'il souhaite apporter.\n"
"\n"
"Exemple (image fournie) :\n"
"    Quelles modifications souhaitez-vous apporter à cette image ?\n"
"    - moment de la journée.\n"
"    - intensité du flou de mouvement.\n"
"    - style de l'arrière-plan.\n"
"Exemple (aucune image) :\n"
"    Veuillez fournir une image et indiquer les améliorations que vous "
"souhaitez y apporter."

